                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/ftl---portrait-1200-x-1600-1200x1600-9e6c8fe22fc3.png",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Subset Games",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Subset Games",
                    "description": "# Complex Strategic Gameplay \n\nGive orders to your crew, manage ship power distribution and choose weapon targets in the heat of battle.\n\n![Faster Than Light Image](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/Diesel%2Fproductv2%2Ffaster-than-light%2Fhome%2FEGS_SubsetGames_FTLFasterThanLight_G2_01-1920x1080-cca82ee957c95bea3b3ece9623b39bac9c1c1dc8.jpg)\n\n# Play at Your Own Speed\n\nPause the game mid-combat to evaluate your strategy and give orders.\n\n![Faster Than Light Image](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/Diesel%2Fproductv2%2Ffaster-than-light%2Fhome%2FEGS_SubsetGames_FTLFasterThanLight_G2_03-1280x720-05962c046a6910be56d1a366271737483dc50069.jpg)\n\n# Unique Lifeforms and Technology \n\nUpgrade your ship and unlock new ones with the help of six diverse alien races.\n\n![Faster Than Light Image](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/Diesel%2Fproductv2%2Ffaster-than-light%2Fhome%2FEGS_SubsetGames_FTLFasterThanLight_G2_05-1280x720-a7669a70e851dbff2c67f975d27ed28534226942.jpg)\n\n# Be the Captain You Want \n\nHundreds of text based encounters will force you to make tough decisions.\n\n![Faster Than Light Image](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/Diesel%2Fproductv2%2Ffaster-than-light%2Fhome%2FEGS_SubsetGames_FTLFasterThanLight_G2_07-1280x720-51c8981c4334a78b4aa4d722fcf8f13420d4b77d.jpg)\n\n# Randomized Galaxy\n\nEach play-through will feature different enemies, events, and results to your decisions. No two play-throughs will be quite the same.\n\n![Faster Than Light Image](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/Diesel%2Fproductv2%2Ffaster-than-light%2Fhome%2FEGS_SubsetGames_FTLFasterThanLight_G2_09-1280x720-156b63aeddaf2772be277f1a481926253c0813f9.jpg)\n\n# No Second Chances!\n\nPermadeath means when you die, there's no coming back. The constant threat of defeat adds importance and tension to every action.",
                    "shortDescription": "This \"spaceship simulation roguelike-like\" allows you to take your ship and crew on an adventure through a randomly generated galaxy filled with glory and bitter defeat.",
                    "title": "FTL: Faster Than Light",
